  "about": "Progressions are Roman numerals, one entry per bar (two numerals in an entry split the bar). Pattern notes are [start, length, tones, velocity] in quarter notes; tones name chord tones: R root, 3, 5, 7 (the octave if the chord has no 7th), 8 octave, 6, b7, 5- (fifth below), A (a half step below the next chord's root), C (the whole voiced chord), v0-v3 (one note of the voicing), joined with + for several.",

